-% FAccT 2027 Revision Roadmap
-% Notes for transforming the AI4Good workshop paper into a high-impact full paper
-
-\documentclass[11pt]{article}
-
-\usepackage[margin=1in]{geometry}
-\usepackage{enumitem}
